        "name": "Windhoek city and Katutura township tour",
        "description": "The compact capital, with a German-colonial centre and a township food and culture tour.",
        "details": "Windhoek has Christuskirche, the Independence Memorial Museum and craft markets. A Katutura township tour includes the Soweto Market, where meat is grilled on the street, and a visit to a community project. Sundays are quiet in the centre.",
