        "name": "Sossusvlei, Dune 45 and Deadvlei",
        "description": "The tallest red dunes in the world and a white clay pan of dead camelthorn trees.",
        "details": "Sossusvlei is reached from the Sesriem gate before sunrise. Dune 45 or Big Daddy can be climbed for the morning light, and Deadvlei is a clay pan with black ancient trees. It is cold at dawn and very hot by midday. Sesriem Canyon is a short stop.",
